meta {
  name: activity
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/inventory/activity
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  pageSize: 20
  ~search: amoxicillin
  ~logType: stock_out
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Inventory Activity

  Returns paginated stock movement history for the authenticated workspace together with totals calculated over the filtered result set.

  ## Authorization

  Requires an authenticated user with an active workspace membership.

  ## Query Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Required | Allowed Values / Rules | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|------------------------|-------------|
  | `page` | numeric string | No | Integer greater than or equal to `1` | Page to return. |
  | `pageSize` | numeric string | No | Integer from `1` to `100` | Rows per page. |
  | `search` | string | No | Non-empty after trimming | Case-insensitive drug-name search. |
  | `logType` | string | No | `damaged`, `expired`, `opening_stock`, `reconciliation`, `stock_in`, `stock_out` | Restricts results to one movement type. |

  ## Success Response

  **`200 OK`**

  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Inventory activity fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "stats": {
        "movementCount": 14,
        "stockInQuantity": 350,
        "stockOutQuantity": 95
      },
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "pageSize": 20,
        "pageCount": 1,
        "total": 14
      },
      "rows": [
        {
          "id": "stock-log-uuid",
          "drug": {
            "id": "drug-uuid",
            "name": "Amoxil",
            "genericName": "Amoxicillin",
            "strength": "500 mg",
            "unit": "Capsule"
          },
          "logType": "stock_out",
          "quantity": 10,
          "reason": "patient",
          "notes": "Patient dispense",
          "unitCostKobo": 25000,
          "person": "Jane Pharmacist",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-30T10:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Notes

  - Rows are ordered newest first.
  - `reason` is null for movement types that do not require a stock-out reason.
  - Statistics use the same workspace and filters as the table query.
  - Monetary values are integer kobo.

  ## Errors

  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Authentication is invalid or workspace access is suspended. |
  | `422 Unprocessable Entity` | A query parameter is invalid. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Activity retrieval failed unexpectedly. |
}
